rs  yesterday he rejected that criticism  outside the church I  understand why people don't think that  you can look at a videotape eight of  them and decipher what has happened and  we were able to do that and Lana officer  Devon Brosnan is adamant that he did  nothing wrong that night  meantime separately the state  legislature has passed hate crimes  legislation it now goes to the  governor's desk he is expected to sign  it did you know that Georgia is one of  four states around the country that does  not have hate crimes laws gale I did  know that because I watch CBS this  morning so this is a very big deal Jeff  that this is now heading to the  governor's desk for signature thank you  very much
 

